title: "LH-Radiology Multi-Agent System"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-07-15
license: MPL-2.0
repository-code: "https://gitlab.com/librehealth/radiology/lh-radiology-agents"
abstract: >-
  Five A2A agents and a Temporal orchestrator that drive a radiology study from
  PACS arrival through result communication, on LibreHealth Radiology (OpenMRS)
  as EHR/RIS, fhir2 as the FHIR R4 data API, Orthanc PACS, and the OHIF viewer.
